 "intro": {
  "@es": "Hoy aprendes a decir qué es seguro, qué es probable y qué es casi imposible. En ruso hay palabras cortas para cada grado de seguridad, y se colocan delante del verbo.",
  "@en": "Today you learn to say what is safe, what is likely and what is almost impossible. In Russian there are short words for each degree of security, and they are placed in front of the verb."
